orbidden: oracle fixtures pin behaviour; they do not legitimize a\\\\\\\\n  2450\\\\\\\\tcontradictory normative rule.\\\\\\\\n  2451\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  2452\\\\\\\\tThe landing gate is therefore: every claimed-row fixture equals the oracle;\\\\\\\\n  2453\\\\\\\\tevery corner's departure fixture equals its recorded deviation; no fixture\\\\\\\\n  2454\\\\\\\\tfailure is unclassified. A new finding lands in one of four bins, in blocking\\\\\\\\n  2455\\\\\\\\torder:\\\\\\\\n  2456\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  2457\\\\\\\\t1. a defect in a claimed row (blocks);\\\\\\\\n  2458\\\\\\\\t2. a missing row required by an exit criterion or the C4 profile (blocks);\\\\\\\\n  2459\\\\\\\\t3. a reclassification request, row to corner (an Architect decision recorded\\\\\\\\n  2460\\\\\\\\t   in the ledger; blocks until decided);\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\"}}\\\\n{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.started\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_11\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rg -n '8\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.6|eval|JVM|parse|compiler' docs/design/yang.antlr.md; rg -n 'php|source|JVM' src/cljc/yang/stage.cljc; rg --files src | rg 'yang/.+(parse|stage)|php'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\":null,\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"in_progress\\\\\\\"}}\\\\n{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_11\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"command_execution\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"command\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rg -n '8\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\.6|eval|JVM|parse|compiler' docs/design/yang.antlr.md; rg -n 'php|source|JVM' src/cljc/yang/stage.cljc; rg --files src | rg 'yang/.+(parse|stage)|php'\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"aggregated_output\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"8:pi