carries a request identity. The\\\\\\\\n   871\\\\\\\\tcompiler coordinator consumes those descriptors and appends outcomes.\\\\\\\\n   872\\\\\\\\tPortable code never calls the compiler as a function.\\\\\\\\n   873\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   874\\\\\\\\t### 6.2 Respect the existing outcome algebra\\\\\\\\n   875\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   876\\\\\\\\tCompiler outcomes and DaoStream outcomes occupy different layers:\\\\\\\\n   877\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   878\\\\\\\\t```clojure\\\\\\\\n   879\\\\\\\\t;; Successful observation of a failed compilation.\\\\\\\\n   880\\\\\\\\t{:dao.stream/outcome :dao.stream/ok\\\\\\\\n   881\\\\\\\\t :dao.stream/value\\\\\\\\n   882\\\\\\\\t {:yang.compile/outcome :yang.compile/rejected\\\\\\\\n   883\\\\\\\\t  :yang.compile/request [\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"client-token\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" 12]\\\\\\\\n   884\\\\\\\\t  :yang.compile/reason :yang.compile/syntax-error}\\\\\\\\n   885\\\\\\\\t :dao.stream/cursor successor}\\\\\\\\n   886\\\\\\\\t```\\\\\\\\n   887\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n   888\\\\\\\\tDo not invent `:dao.stream/syntax-error` or extend DaoStream's seven\\\\\\\\n   889\\\\\\\\toperations.\\\\\\\\n   890\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3416\\\\\\\\t### 8.6 Object-oriented and web: PHP, mixed text and ordered maps\\\\\\\\n  3417\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3418\\\\\\\\tThe lexer uses modes to preserve HTML/text and PHP regions in source\\\\\\\\n  3419\\\\\\\\torder. Text outside code lowers to ordered output effects; it is not\\\\\\\\n  3420\\\\\\\\tdiscarded by stripping tags.\\\\\\\\n  3421\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3422\\\\\\\\tPHP arrays require ordered-map behavior, including key conversion and\\\\\\\\n  3423\\\\\\\\titeration rules. A plain host hash map is not a sufficient\\\\\\\\n  3424\\\\\\\\trepresentation.\\\\\\\\n  3425\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3426\\\\\\\\tThe semantic profile must cover:\\\\\\\\n  3427\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3428\\\\\\\\t- `$var` binding and function/global/static scope.\\\\\\\\n  3429\\\\\\\\t- Capture by value versus capture by reference.\\\\\\\\n  3430\\\\\\\\t- References and aliasing.\\\\\\\\n  3431\\\\\\\\t- Ordered arrays and observable copy behavior.\\\\\\\\n  3432\\\\\\\\t- Coercion, comparisons, missing values, and error behavior.\\\\\\\\n  3433\\\\\\\\t- Function and class calls, including supported type declarations.\\\\\\\\n  3434\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3435\\\\\\\\tSection 8.11 maps PHP arrays, objects, and references onto cells.\\\\\\\\n  3436\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3437\\\\\\\\tSuperglobals are explicit request-context values supplied by the\\\\\\\\n  3438\\\\\\\\tcomposition. They do not read ambient process or HTTP state.\\\\\\\\n  3439\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3440\\\\\\\\t`include` and `require` perform module-resolution effects with recorded\\\\\\\\n  3441\\\\\\\\tinputs. `eval` is a new compilation request, subject to the same\\\\\\\\n  3442\\\\\\\\tprofiles and diagnostics.\\\\\\\\n  3443\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3444\\\\\\\\tThe existing frontend's ignored type hints and limited closure handling\\\\\\\\n  3445\\\\\\\\tare migration limitations, not semantics to preserve as the new default.\\\\\\\\n  3446\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3447\\\\\\\\t### 8.7 Prototype: JavaScript, lexical environments and jobs\\\\\\\\n  3448\\\\\\\\t\\\\\\\\n  3449\\\\\\\\tThe frontend distinguishes script and module goals and pins an\\\\\\\\n  3450\\\\\\\\tECMAScript edition.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"exit_code\\\\\\\":0,\\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"completed\\\\\\\"}}\\\\n{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.started\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_19\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"web_search\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"exec-92c29eac-57ed-4dc2-8bbd-58f8d7c91a6e\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"query\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"action\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"other\\\\\\\"}}}\\\\n{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item.completed\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"item_19\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"web_search\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"exec-92c29eac-57ed-4dc2-8bbd-58f8d7c91a6e\\\\