d `php-8.3.35`\\\\n    19\\\\t(`php:8.3-cli` on shiva, banner `php-8.3.35 shiva 2026-10-25`).\\\\n    20\\\\t\\\\n    21\\\\t- Lowered and oracle-pinned: references (`=&` in every location form,\\\\n\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":0,\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\"}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_40\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"agent_message\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"One more gap belongs in the implementation plan: `try-require` returns a module name, not an export callable. I’ll specify a small, profiled accessor for an already installed export to complete the handoff. I’ll also keep redeclaration timing, method context, eval-local statics, and diagnostic locations pending until the PHP 8.3.35 oracle pins them.\\\"}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.started\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_41\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_execution\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\"nl -ba src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc | sed -n '5300,5385p'; nl -ba src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc | sed -n '3401,3426p'\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"aggregated_output\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"exit_code\\\":null,\\\"status\\\":\\\"in_progress\\\"}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"item.completed\\\",\\\"item\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"item_41\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"command_execution\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"/bin/zsh -lc \\\\\\\"nl -ba src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/prelude.cljc | sed -n '5300,5385p'; nl -ba src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc | sed -n '3401,3426p'\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"aggregated_output\\\":\\\"  5300\\\\t\\\\n  5301\\\\t\\\\n  5302\\\\t(def definitions\\\\n  5303\\\\t  \\\\\\\"The single definition list, `[store-key form]` in definition order: every\\\\n  5304\\\\t   prelude function, the literal state slot, then `php/init!`. Defining them\\\\n  5305\\\\t   runs nothing.\\\\\\\"\\\\n  5306\\\\t  (into (into (into core-definitions module-defs/definitions) p9-defs/definitions)\\\\n  5307\\\\t        [['php.rt/state :php/uninit]\\\\n  5308\\\\t         ['php/init! (init-form)]]))\\\\n  5309\\\\t\\\\n  5310\\\