{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,110p' test/yang/php/antlr/lower_portable_test.cljc; rg -n 'unit-layout|source-violations|validate\"'!'\"' src/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc src/cljc/yang/antlr/packet.cljc\"","aggregated_output":"(ns yang.php.antlr.lower-portable-test\n  \"The lowering on every host from checked-in CST packets: no parser needed,\n   so this runs on the JVM and on Node, and on Dart except the two\n   packet-running fixtures gated below. Covers a golden, the refusal and\n   unhandled-rule diagnostics, tree validation, the stage transform's\n   routing, and every portable fixture run on the AST walker.\"\n  (:require\n    [clojure.test :refer [deftest is testing]]\n    [yang.php.antlr.lower :as lower]\n    [yang.php.antlr.packets :as packets]\n    [yang.php.antlr.packets-p3b :as packets-p3b]\n    [yang.php.antlr.portable-harness :as h]\n    [yang.php.antlr.programs :as programs]\n    [yang.php.antlr.programs-p3b :as p3b]\n    [yang.core.uast :as u]))\n\n\n(def ^:private echo-1\n  (h/packet [:htmlDocument\n             [:phpBlock\n              [:topStatement\n               [:statement\n                [:echoStatement\n                 [\"Echo\" \"echo\"]\n                 [:expressionList\n                  [:expression\n                   [:constant [:literalConstant [:numericConstant [\"Decimal\" \"1\"]]]]]]\n                 [\"SemiColon\" \";\"]]]]]\n             [\"EOF\" \"<EOF>\"]]))\n\n\n(deftest hand-packet-golden-test\n  (is (= (u/app (u/v 'php/echo) (u/app (u/v 'php/to-string) (u/lit 1)))\n         (lower/lower-module-body echo-1))))\n\n\n(defn- diagnostic\n  [pk]\n  (try (lower/lower-module-body pk)\n       nil\n       (catch #?(:cljd Object :clj clojure.lang.ExceptionInfo :cljs ExceptionInfo) e\n         (select-keys (ex-data e) [:yang.php/diagnostic :rule :construct]))))\n\n\n(deftest unknown-rule-fails-qualified-test\n  (is (= {:yang.php/diagnostic :yang.php/unhandled-rule, :rule \"noSuchRule\"}\n         (diagnostic (h/packet [:htmlDocument [:phpBlock [:noSuchRule]]\n                                [\"EOF\" \"<EOF>\"]])))))\n\n\n(deftest unsupported-rule-names-its-construct-test\n  (is (= {:yang.php/diagnostic :yang.php/unsupported,\n          :rule \"gotoStatement\",\n          :construct :goto}\n         (diagnostic (h/packet [:htmlDocument\n                                [:phpBlock [:topStatement [:statement [:gotoStatement]]]]\n                                [\"EOF\" \"<EOF>\"]])))))\n\n\n(deftest malformed-packet-is-refused-test\n  (is (= :yang.php/malformed-cst\n         (try (lower/lower-module-body (assoc echo-1 :yang.cst/root 99))\n              (catch #?(:cljd Object :clj clojure.lang.ExceptionInfo :cljs ExceptionInfo) e\n                (:yang.php/diagnostic (ex-data e)))))))\n\n\n;; Same Dart gate as portable-fixtures-test below: `lower-through-stage`\n;; builds the same prelude-chained program (even for the one-line echo-1\n;; packet) and its tail marking overflows the Dart stack.\n#?(:cljd nil\n   :default\n   (deftest stage-routes-programs-and-diagnostics-test\n     (testing \"an ok packet is one program batch\"\n       (is (contains? (h/lower-through-stage echo-1) :ast)))\n     (testing \"a refusal is one diagnostic and no program\"\n       (let [r (h/lower-through-stage\n                 (h/packet [:htmlDocument\n                            [:phpBlock [:topStatement [:statement [:gotoStatement]]]]\n                            [\"EOF\" \"<EOF>\"]]))]\n         (is (= :yang.php/unsupported\n                (:yang.php/diagnostic (first (:diagnostics r)))))\n         (is (= :goto (:construct (first (:diagnostics r)))))))))\n\n\n;; Dart gate (2026-11-08): a lowered program chains the PHP prelude through\n;; `yang.core.uast/seq-nodes`, so one fixture's stage AST is ~900 frames deep\n;; (measured depth 909, 103402 datoms) and the recursive walkers it then\n;; crosses (`yang.tails/mark-tails`, `yin.vm/datoms->ast`) overflow the Dart\n;; stack where the JVM (-Xss64m) and Node complete. The lowering itself is\n;; host-correct (this test is green on the JVM); making those shared walkers\n;; iterative is the un-gating fix and lives outside the php test surface.\n#?(:cljd nil\n   :default\n   (deftest portable-fixtures-test\n     (doseq [[id form] packets/forms\n             :let [{:keys [out carrier diag uncaught oracle]}\n                   (first (filter #(= id (:id %)) programs/fixtures))\n                   r (h/run-packet-raw (h/packet form))]]\n       (is (not= :pending oracle) (name id))\n       (is (= (or carrier out) (:php/out r)) (name id))\n       (is (= (vec diag) (mapv (juxt :errno :message) (:php/diag r))) (name id))\n       (is (= uncaught (some-> (:php/uncaught r) (select-keys [:class :message])))\n           (name id)))))\n\n\n;; Same Dart gate as portable-fixtures-test above: same prelude-chained\n;; stage AST, same recursive walkers, same Stack Overflow on Dart.\n#?(:cljd nil\n   :default\n   (deftest enabled-stage0-fixtures-run-from-packets-test\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:397:(defn- unit-layout\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3695:   (let [pk (p/validate! packet {:diagnostic-ns diagnostic-ns})\nsrc/cljc/yang/php/antlr/lower.cljc:3703:         ctx (merge ctx (unit-layout ctx))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/antlr/packet.cljc:30:   Invariants every target's exporter must meet (`validate!` checks 1, 6 and\nsrc/cljc/yang/antlr/packet.cljc:35:        (`validate!`).\nsrc/cljc/yang/antlr/packet.cljc:365:(defn- source-violations\nsrc/cljc/yang/antlr/packet.cljc:420:      (source-violations packet source))))\nsrc/cljc/yang/antlr/packet.cljc:423:(defn validate!\nsrc/cljc/yang/antlr/packet.cljc:429:  ([packet] (validate! packet nil))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
